Now it is midday.
Prakash and I are walking to the cafeteria.
We go inside the cafeteria.
There are a lot of people there.
We sit near a table.
Prakash is buying food.
He comes to the table.
He is eating a Kerala meal.
There is rice and curries on the plate.
I am opening my lunchbox.
I bring lunch from home.
Today I have rice and vegetables.
I am eating my food.
"Is the food tasty?" Prakash asks.
"Yes, it has good taste," I say.
We are talking about office matters.
We finish eating our food.
We are going out of the cafeteria.
We walk to the office again.
